  LastBuildReport: "WorldBuilder \u2014 22 placed, 0 missing, 288 colliders, 3.7s\nconfig.ts
    cdbbaccf6923  districts:True places:True colliders:True\n\nPLACED\n  Atmosphere
    \u2014 linear fog 9FB8D4 over 328\u20131313 m, camera draws to 1500 m (config
    says 320 m \u2014 three.js budget, not design)\n  Ground 1400 x 1400 m @ y -0.05,
    solid over Unity x [-700, 430] (trimmed at the shore)\n  Roads 13 spline(s),
    1864 m total, 8 m wide @ y 0.02\n  Water 2400 x 600 m @ Unity x [430, 2830],
    level 0\n  Beach 100 x 600 m, Unity x [405, 505], ramps to y -3\n  Shore wall
    3 x 8 x 600 m @ Unity x 430 (Ignore Raycast, collider only)\n  District_FirstOne
    @ (0, 0, 0)\n  District_ProceduralCity3 @ (-156, 0, 0)\n  District_ProceduralCity2
    @ (150, 0, 0)\n  District_ProceduralCity4 @ (0, 0, 245)\n  District_ProceduralCity5
