    @ (216.9, 0, -246)\n  Place_SevenEleven @ (-37, 0.22, -15) yaw 90\xB0\n  Place_PizzaPlace
    @ (-20, 0.15, -100) yaw 0\xB0\n  Place_GasStation @ (320.9, 0, -123.3) yaw 0\xB0\n 
    Place_PoliceStation @ (160, 0, -124.5) yaw 180\xB0\n  Place_PizzaInterior @ (-1000,
    0, 1000)\n  LotCars \u2014 101 parked cars in 101 filled stalls\n  Navigation
    142 street(s) carved into 172 volume(s), 230 zebra crossing(s), NavMesh baked
    over the districts\n\nWARNINGS\n  District_ProceduralCity5: 2 texture(s) have
    no compressed copy and stay RGB24 \u2014 run The Block \u2192 Compress Textures
    (TexturesCom_ConcretePlates0211_1_seamless_S)\n  District_ProceduralCity6: 4
    texture(s) have no compressed copy and stay RGB24 \u2014 run The Block \u2192
    Compress Textures (TexturesCom_ConcretePlates0211_1_seamless_S)\n  District_ProceduralCity7:
    6 texture(s) have no compressed copy and stay RGB24 \u2014 run The Block \u2192
    Compress Textures (TexturesCom_ConcretePlates0211_1_seamless_S)\n  Pizza Place
    \u2014 stand-in low_poly_pizza_restaurant.glb for pizza-lila.glb: lies on its
    back out of the box; righted and lifted onto the pavement\n  Gas Station \u2014
    gas-station.glb corrected on import: Sketchfab export imports with Y and Z swapped;
    righted\n\nSTILL BLENDED \u2014 deliberate; suspects if anything else renders
    pale\n  Building Facade.001, CityGenGlass.001, CityGenTCom_DecalsStain0047_1_masked_S,
    CityGenTCom_DecalsStain0057_1_masked_S, CityGenTCom_DecalsStain0094_2_masked_S,
    CityGen_lanes_secondary_color, Material, Material.001, Material.003, SE_glass,
    US_Doors_1, decal_flag, glass\n\nNOTES\n  Ground: sea footprint cut out \u2014
    Unity x [430, 700] z [-546, 54], so wave troughs cannot expose the plate\n  facade
    tint bound to 1 material slot(s)\n  District_FirstOne: 1 collider(s)\n  District_ProceduralCity3:
    stripped 2 baked-car submesh(es) out of 1 merged mesh(es)\n  District_ProceduralCity3:
    alpha-clipped FoliageTrees.001, FoliageTrees.002, FoliageTrees.003, FoliageTrees.004,
    Street_Assets, Street_Assets.001\n  District_ProceduralCity3: filled 1 empty
